{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Purple_Descriptions_Scaled.gif?t=1744226434\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Sheeple_Features_Gif.gif?t=1744226434\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Neko_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Procedural Map Generation,</strong> each time you join an online game or start a new campaign brand-new maps are created</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Pink_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Deck Building,</strong> Summon Undead create a Black Hole, or <strong><i>Drop a Nuke</i></strong> use your best cards to achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Ily_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Army Building,</strong> choose from a variety of units ranging from rats up to High-tech pandas to build an undefeated army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Necro_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Intractable Maps,</strong> throw your enemies into holes, hit explosive barrels, or trigger wasp hives to annihilate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Christmass_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Solo Campaign,</strong> play alone in the campaign mode to conquer the world and regain the original sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Engenier_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Online Multiplayer,</strong> join an online multiplayer match to fight and defeat other Sheeple <i>(no limit on player count)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>Local Multiplayer &amp; Online Local Multiplayer</strong> <i>(Join online games with your local players [no limit on local player count] )</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Poison_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1744226434\" /><strong>And so much more!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Blue_Descriptions_Scaled.gif?t=1744226434\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Green_Descriptions_Scaled.gif?t=1744226434\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921480?t=1744226434","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921480?t=1744226434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/aec70cd9f5feecd09f267577524c2b1e395941f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744226434","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/aec70cd9f5feecd09f267577524c2b1e395941f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744226434","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}